力によってダンテは敗北し悲惨に降伏宣言するダンテ\n[さっきは偉大な悪魔様たちに生意気な言行をして申し訳ありません。 なにとぞ愚かな半人半魔を許してください。お願いします！]\n<続き> は いつか!!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1wKuh_me--cFVkeqUEsigOb7xWFAZYwRG/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 171, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@safasyota/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/846cdd64/uploads/origins/c0364a89-b53e-4e32-9f9a-260e2a8b5265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2c3abc3d9e422fabd02f9396af93f415", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/846cdd64/uploads/origins/c0364a89-b53e-4e32-9f9a-260e2a8b5265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2c3abc3d9e422fabd02f9396af93f415, https://si.imgix.net/846cdd64/uploads/origins/c0364a89-b53e-4e32-9f9a-260e2a8b5265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31da23ca6ab3f8d76215d46fafd35f85 2x, https://si.imgix.net/846cdd64/uploads/origins/c0364a89-b53e-4e32-9f9a-260e2a8b5265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c8e364da3fb70d66e910703cd8f586f4 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 512113, "nc": 160}, {"path": "/@safasyota/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 512113, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac9e59e9/uploads/origins/4cf9b242-5049-40fa-a53c-2f6017708af5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4923c1a3cc7252e83f960158f44c6b9f", "srcset": "htt